   "_levels": "喂饼's levels, here once (2026-10-16): the beat gets them through Look (the task's deal, look.mjs), mount() alone reads them here. World 360×440: the 饼 at `bread` hung from `vines` (anchor `at`, optional `slack`), the fox's mouth at `mouth` (`fox_flip`: facing left), `stones` (x, y, w, h, a degrees), a `gust` puff at `at` blowing `to`, an optional `piece` (a 饼角, a star), `say` the hint. Each is solved by order alone; games/bots/bread.js holds the answers.",
   "levels": [
     {"id": "one", "bread": [150, 160], "vines": [{"at": [150, 34]}], "mouth": [150, 378], "say": {"zh": "饼挂在藤上。划断它。", "en": "The bread hangs from a vine. Cut it."}},
     {"id": "two", "bread": [180, 150], "vines": [{"at": [50, 34]}, {"at": [300, 34]}], "mouth": [298, 378], "fox_flip": true, "piece": [232, 186], "say": {"zh": "两根藤。先断哪一根？", "en": "Two vines. Which one first?"}},
