   "_levels": "射鹿 · 拉弓, a 愤怒小鸟-style prototype (2026-10-16) — in the 游戏厅 only; the story's 射鹿 is still `deer`. World 480×300: he stands on the near bank at the right (the bow at 426,192), the deer drinks to the left. `deer`: `x`, `face` (-1 looks left), `lift` {every, for} ms its head comes up, `walk` {to, ms, rest} back and forth. `wind`: + blows in his face (pushes the arrow right). `things`: a `reed` {at, h, lean?, breaks? (speed, default 5)} snaps when the arrow is fast enough, else turns it; a `branch` {from, to} turns it always. `hint`: after a miss, 银月's 「往左偏半寸」 and a tick left of the deer. games/bots/deerarc.js searches each level's aim.",
